# Target Zones

A horizontal `sortable()` pool feeds three `target()` slots that each hold at most one item. Drop a square onto an occupied slot and the previous occupant FLIPs back into the pool — the drop handler does the swap, `controller.animateLayout` animates every displaced neighbour to its new layout position.

The ghost morphs round → square as it crosses into a slot via a custom `ghost` snippet that toggles a class based on `controller.dropPreview`.

